{"page":20004,"part":1,"text":"九势\n\n\n夫书肇于自然，自然既立，阴阳生矣，阴阳既生，形势出矣。藏头护尾，力在其中，下笔用力，肌肤之丽。故曰：势来不可止，势去不可遏，惟笔软则奇怪生焉。\n\n凡落笔结字，上皆覆下，下以承上，使其形势递相映带，无使势背。\n\n转笔，宜左右回顾，无使节目孤露。\n\n藏锋，点画出入之迹，欲左先右，至回左亦尔。\n\n藏头，圆笔属纸，令笔心常在点画中行。\n\n护尾，画点势尽，力收之。\n\n疾势，出于啄磔之中，又在竖笔紧趯之内。\n\n掠笔，在于趱锋峻趯用之。\n\n涩势，在于紧駃战行之法。\n\n横鳞，竖勒之规。\n\n此名九势，得之虽无师授，亦能妙合古人。须翰墨功多，即造妙境耳。\n\n空白页","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20004,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"75c0ae325237a8e14f7ae4935515f81cbf96608dcd34c44ebee638e3966f5d9b","textSha256":"75c0ae325237a8e14f7ae4935515f81cbf96608dcd34c44ebee638e3966f5d9b","fileSha256":"75c0ae325237a8e14f7ae4935515f81cbf96608dcd34c44ebee638e3966f5d9b","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20004-work-009.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"九势 · 九势","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/27f3VHLiPH7KmWB3rpmNfS","originalPages":[18,19,20],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"97ac5e4962a0f71da2b9f859121bb4664ccf98b3cf699202b1dd5f76546ab8da","id":"local-18-175-184","page_id":18,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":175,"rawEnd":184,"reviewedTextSha256":"6ac95982d270fdbb539df39edc9bfb8af0b791480729f3acdf9fc89df5c4d4c5","displayUnitOrigins":[[181,182],[182,183],[183,184]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":18,"part":1,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"肖源","verifiedAt":"2026-10-16T16:12:37.524Z","revision":"6ac95982d270fdbb539df39edc9bfb8af0b791480729f3acdf9fc89df5c4d4c5","textSha256":"6ac95982d270fdbb539df39edc9bfb8af0b791480729f3acdf9fc89df5c4d4c5","fileSha256":"ad332b4eae3f30c21b0b14df4e6aca0762c12d9ead12d0383229c6055155d677","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-17-part1-recheck/member-input/第1份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-17-part1-recheck/member-input/第1份-TXT校验表.csv"}},{"start":5,"end":76,"sourceTextSha256":"23e9f15d59e188ff179a1